  "guid": "wtf.archangel.lotsoflootredux",
  "name": "Lots of Loot Redux",
  "slug": "lots-of-loot-redux",
  "teaser": "Tired of having barely any loot in your raids? Lots of Loot Redux aims to bring back that old Tarkov feeling from when loot wasn't so scarce. If you are a loot goblin then this mod is for you!",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2212.jpg",
  "downloads": 211931,
  "favourites_count": 166,
  "description": "<p>Updated with permission of <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/11181-rainbowpc/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">RainbowPC</a>, all credit to him for all of his work on this amazing mod.</p>\n<p><strong>Lots of Loot Redux</strong></p>\n<p>A mod for SPT that makes loot a lot less scarce, definitively nowhere near vanilla though this mod’s configuration file is very detailed and everything can be tuned up or down depending on the user’s needs.</p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<p>Loot in loose loot containers</p>\n<p>This mod re-adds the pre 12.12 feature of items spawning in loose containers, as well as expanding on that functionality by also allowing it to use this feature for backpacks as well.</p>\n<p>Marked rooms</p>\n<p>Lots of Loot Redux introduces full configurability for marked rooms. Want more loot? Less loot? Rare items only? With the customizable settings this mods gives you can easily fine-tune these to your liking.</p>\n<p>And plenty more!</p>\n<p><strong>Installation</strong>:\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"\" />\n(In the GIF it says ‘Live Flea Prices’, but the installation is the same)</p>\n",
  "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1619/lots-of-loot-redux",
