    {
      "id": 13713,
      "hub_id": null,
      "version": "4.1.0",
      "description": "<ul>\n<li>Loot overlay has been fixed up to work again, being broke since the 3.11 -&gt; 4.0 migration</li>\n<li>Decoupled marked room loot generation from main loot generation, this will allow marked room loot to be more configurable</li>\n<li>Add Ref Key Rooms by @minesettimi (Thanks!)</li>\n<li>A lot of preparation to allow for presets in the future, but all of that has been disabled for now</li>\n<li>Some huge code refactors to various loot generation systems</li>\n<li>Added new properties <code>ReduceLowLooseLootRolls</code> and <code>ReduceLowLooseLootRollsAmount</code>  these properties allow for raising the lower end of the RNG loot rolls that takes place.</li>\n<li>Fixed up marked room positions to be more accurate and include the walls (As sometimes posters can spawn on these)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>There’s probably another few things I forgot, but considering this has been in dev since the middle of November of last year these are the changes that I can still remember.</p>\n<p><strong>It is recommended to use a new config, the config layout has changed due to preparation for presets.</strong></p>\n",
      "link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1619/lots-of-loot-redux/4.1.0",
